---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base lang="en" alternates={{ fr: '/confidentialite', en: '/en/privacy' }} title="Privacy — nia" description="Privacy policy of the nia website.">
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>Comparing on nia requires no account and no personal data.</p>
    <h2>What nia does not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>nia sets no advertising or tracking cookies.</li>
      <li>The amounts and countries you choose stay in your browser (in the page address).</li>
      <li>Fonts are hosted on the site: your browser contacts no third party to display them.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Audience measurement</h2>
    <p>If enabled, audience measurement uses <span class="todo">[Plausible Analytics]</span>, without cookies and without identifying personal data.</p>
    <h2>Links to providers</h2>
    <p>When you click "Send with…", you leave nia for the provider's website or its affiliate programme, which may set its own cookies. Please read that provider's privacy policy.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any question: <span class="todo">[contact email]</span>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
